"body": "Two visitor findings from the level 2 look.\n\n1. **'1 comments'**: 14 of 31 counts on the home page read wrong. One helper now words comments, posts and discussions in the right number. Local build: 0 of 31 wrong, 14 read '1 comment'.\n2. **Thread header stacked and sticky**: the bare `header` and `footer` rules for the site also applied to the thread header, each comment header and their footers (4 of 4 measured live: sticky, blurred, extra padding). They are now scoped to `body > header` and `body > footer`. Local build at 1280 and 390 wide: thread header 203px to 41px, in one row; site header and footer unchanged.",
